\caption(Explicit compact-model Adam fits, retaining every block. Training uses independent crop/flip augmentation and batch BN moments; Validation inference selects paired parameter/moving-state checkpoints. The full official test set is used only after selection.)
\alttext(Explicit compact-model Adam fits, retaining every block. Training uses independent crop/flip augmentation and batch BN moments; Validation inference selects paired parameter/moving-state checkpoints. The full official test set is used only after selection.)

The learning curves show stochastic fitting NLL and unaugmented validation NLL.
The table uses the checkpoint's moving moments for deterministic inference.

> Native confusion matrices

These matrices use the held-out predictions from the executed program above.
The native `ConfusionMatrix` SVG API labels exact counts with true classes
running from top to bottom and predicted classes from left to right.

\image(figures/resnet_basic_confusion_api_0.svg)
